  "duration_s": 331.929002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "领导的暗示你能听懂吗？你和王宇把后备箱的茅台拿上去。哎，好，哎，这里没有啊，哎呦，被偷了。这张总张总，我去告诉张总，茅台被偷了，哎，你干什么呀？这酒都被偷了，你以为我跟你闹玩呢？我是怕你犯蠢张，总能不知道他车里没有酒吗？职场上最忌讳的就是会错领导的意，这车里没有酒，领导还让你送上去，说明他只在意结果。比起寻找车内酒的去向和真实性，首当其冲的是先满足领导的需求啊，这么点事儿都干不利索。那个领导，您后备箱，我不好意思翻，就自己准备了。四瓶有两瓶，放您后备箱了，这两瓶拿出来，您先用，你这酒量可以啊，这个项目啊就交给你们公司了，谢谢谢谢。慢走啊随风啊，还是你想的周到，把白酒提前换成了雪碧，否则啊李总这一单还真不一定拿得下，这个项目就由你来负责吧。哎，哎，对了，明天下午三点，你们一块来我家商讨一下李总这个项目的方案。好好好好好，哎，张总，我送送你啊。签合同啊是要领导在客户面前保持清醒的，这样也能保证公司形象。那倒瓶矿泉水不就行了，怎么还整瓶雪碧，白酒挂杯，但水不挂，这样更容易被发现。但是雪碧跟白酒一样，都能挂杯，又学到了，这都两点半了，你怎么还不换衣服啊？人王宇早就过去了，现在是竞争副总的关键时刻，咱早点过去好表现，表现呢不着急，早点去显得重视。家是私人场所，不要提前到，尤其是张总家，孩子还小，正是忙乱的时候，万一人家突击准备，你提前去了，多尴尬呀，咱准时到就行。哎，还有啊，你赶紧去把你这身西装给换掉，人家张总让咱们去他家，那是没把咱们当外人，你这穿一身职业装去，这不是跟人家疏远关系吗？好，我这就去换张总张总，这是思义送给嫂子的礼物。你们俩太客气了，来，快进快进。哎呀，来了张总，让你们三点来，你们还真三点来啊。哎，这么久了，咋没见嫂子出现呀，女主人不出现，大概率就是不欢迎他，你想多了吧，随风思夜，你们来啊。哎，嫂子今天为孩子啊弄得到处都是，还没等收拾完，他就来了，也不想想别人方不方便，真不懂礼数来喝水啊。好呀，谢谢张总，哎，谢谢张总。好，就这么决定了啊，时间不早了，就不在家里做了，咱们出去吃吧。好好，哎，正好啊，我媳妇今晚不在家，都没地儿吃饭了。张总啊，我们家还有事儿呢，那我们就先走了。行，既然有事儿就不留你们了啊。哦，嗯嗯张总家的茶是真香，刚才聊的太尽兴，都忘记尝了。随风你也尝一下好喝，那我们就不打扰了。张总张总，我们走了，下次再见。慢走啊，慢走啊，咱家哪有什么事儿啊，嫂子叫咱出去吃饭，咱不去，不是不给面子吗？张总夫人看似是在叫你一块儿吃饭，其实是在下逐客令，像是改天一块吃饭，或者是今天不在家吃了出去吃，这些都不是真的找你吃饭，而是在下逐客令，那都要走了，你怎么还喝起茶来了？喝主人家的茶，是对主人家表示尊重啊啊，原来如此。嗯，随风，你做事有分寸，公司二把手就需要你这种人才。这王宇明明业务能力比我强，我怎么还？能力固然重要，但越是高位的越需要注意人情世故。王宇连这都不懂，张总怎么敢放心把副总的位置交给他，就没想到有这么多讲究啊。人情世故无小事，细节决定成败，你呀多看看这本闲谈高手。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你就每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你也会变成一个会说话的人。当时听到这句话的时候，我的眼泪就出来了。他写的是别人夸你优秀你就回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友？你看很有味道，假如不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。哇，这真是太棒了。在这本书里边，有一句话我特别欣赏。他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，高情商回答，万物皆有裂痕，那是光照进来的地方。哇，这真是太棒了，每一句都很有意思，随便翻，对吧？哇，这句话太好了，他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，你就回比以前好多了。现在吃泡面敢放两根肠了。我读到这段的时候，我觉得这个让我真是一解心开啊，这本书就像是个社交宝典，把各种社交场景都变成了问题加答案的形式。你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。我觉得这书适合所有人，让你不管，在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏，所以强烈推荐。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00001",
      "start_ms": 270,
      "end_ms": 2470,
      "text": "领导的暗示你能听懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4030,
      "end_ms": 6570,
      "text": "你和王宇把后备箱的茅台拿上去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6650,
      "end_ms": 6890,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6930,
      "end_ms": 7285,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10190,
      "end_ms": 10430,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10670,
      "end_ms": 11510,
      "text": "这里没有啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13210,
      "end_ms": 13610,
      "text": "哎呦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13750,
      "end_ms": 14330,
      "text": "被偷了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14330,
      "end_ms": 15430,
      "text": "这张总张总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16490,
      "end_ms": 17290,
      "text": "我去告诉张总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17290,
      "end_ms": 18110,
      "text": "茅台被偷了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19370,
      "end_ms": 19610,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00013",
      "start_ms": 19610,
      "end_ms": 20330,
      "text": "你干什么呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00014",
      "start_ms": 20590,
      "end_ms": 21510,
      "text": "这酒都被偷了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00015",
      "start_ms": 21510,
      "end_ms": 22470,
      "text": "你以为我跟你闹玩呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00016",
      "start_ms": 22630,
      "end_ms": 24090,
      "text": "我是怕你犯蠢张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00017",
      "start_ms": 24090,
      "end_ms": 25770,
      "text": "总能不知道他车里没有酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00018",
      "start_ms": 25950,
      "end_ms": 28470,
      "text": "职场上最忌讳的就是会错领导的意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00019",
      "start_ms": 28510,
      "end_ms": 29410,
      "text": "这车里没有酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00020",
      "start_ms": 29770,
      "end_ms": 31090,
      "text": "领导还让你送上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00021",
      "start_ms": 31090,
      "end_ms": 32330,
      "text": "说明他只在意结果。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00022",
      "start_ms": 32490,
      "end_ms": 34550,
      "text": "比起寻找车内酒的去向和真实性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00023",
      "start_ms": 34690,
      "end_ms": 37210,
      "text": "首当其冲的是先满足领导的需求啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00024",
      "start_ms": 37390,
      "end_ms": 39140,
      "text": "这么点事儿都干不利索。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00025",
      "start_ms": 39920,
      "end_ms": 40580,
      "text": "那个领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00026",
      "start_ms": 40860,
      "end_ms": 41580,
      "text": "您后备箱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00027",
      "start_ms": 41580,
      "end_ms": 42360,
      "text": "我不好意思翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00028",
      "start_ms": 42520,
      "end_ms": 43260,
      "text": "就自己准备了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00029",
      "start_ms": 43260,
      "end_ms": 44460,
      "text": "四瓶有两瓶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00030",
      "start_ms": 44460,
      "end_ms": 45340,
      "text": "放您后备箱了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00031",
      "start_ms": 45460,
      "end_ms": 46360,
      "text": "这两瓶拿出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00032",
      "start_ms": 46380,
      "end_ms": 46900,
      "text": "您先用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00033",
      "start_ms": 46960,
      "end_ms": 48400,
      "text": "你这酒量可以啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00034",
      "start_ms": 48900,
      "end_ms": 51140,
      "text": "这个项目啊就交给你们公司了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00035",
      "start_ms": 51200,
      "end_ms": 51980,
      "text": "谢谢谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00036",
      "start_ms": 52140,
      "end_ms": 54380,
      "text": "慢走啊随风啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00037",
      "start_ms": 54560,
      "end_ms": 55700,
      "text": "还是你想的周到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00038",
      "start_ms": 55820,
      "end_ms": 57620,
      "text": "把白酒提前换成了雪碧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00039",
      "start_ms": 57820,
      "end_ms": 60480,
      "text": "否则啊李总这一单还真不一定拿得下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00040",
      "start_ms": 60640,
      "end_ms": 62400,
      "text": "这个项目就由你来负责吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00041",
      "start_ms": 62400,
      "end_ms": 62580,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00042",
      "start_ms": 62580,
      "end_ms": 62820,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00043",
      "start_ms": 62900,
      "end_ms": 63415,
      "text": "对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00044",
      "start_ms": 63860,
      "end_ms": 64780,
      "text": "明天下午三点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00045",
      "start_ms": 64900,
      "end_ms": 67720,
      "text": "你们一块来我家商讨一下李总这个项目的方案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00046",
      "start_ms": 67760,
      "end_ms": 69065,
      "text": "好好好好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00047",
      "start_ms": 69830,
      "end_ms": 70010,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00048",
      "start_ms": 70010,
      "end_ms": 70350,
      "text": "张总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00049",
      "start_ms": 70350,
      "end_ms": 71055,
      "text": "我送送你啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00050",
      "start_ms": 72190,
      "end_ms": 75385,
      "text": "签合同啊是要领导在客户面前保持清醒的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00051",
      "start_ms": 75720,
      "end_ms": 77375,
      "text": "这样也能保证公司形象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00052",
      "start_ms": 77970,
      "end_ms": 79595,
      "text": "那倒瓶矿泉水不就行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00053",
      "start_ms": 79980,
      "end_ms": 80900,
      "text": "怎么还整瓶雪碧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00054",
      "start_ms": 81180,
      "end_ms": 82020,
      "text": "白酒挂杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00055",
      "start_ms": 82180,
      "end_ms": 83075,
      "text": "但水不挂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00056",
      "start_ms": 83400,
      "end_ms": 84605,
      "text": "这样更容易被发现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00057",
      "start_ms": 85040,
      "end_ms": 86540,
      "text": "但是雪碧跟白酒一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00058",
      "start_ms": 86680,
      "end_ms": 87565,
      "text": "都能挂杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00059",
      "start_ms": 88460,
      "end_ms": 89160,
      "text": "又学到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00060",
      "start_ms": 89160,
      "end_ms": 90000,
      "text": "这都两点半了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00061",
      "start_ms": 90000,
      "end_ms": 91180,
      "text": "你怎么还不换衣服啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00062",
      "start_ms": 91380,
      "end_ms": 92740,
      "text": "人王宇早就过去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00063",
      "start_ms": 92860,
      "end_ms": 94700,
      "text": "现在是竞争副总的关键时刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00064",
      "start_ms": 94760,
      "end_ms": 95860,
      "text": "咱早点过去好表现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00065",
      "start_ms": 95860,
      "end_ms": 97200,
      "text": "表现呢不着急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00066",
      "start_ms": 97420,
      "end_ms": 98665,
      "text": "早点去显得重视。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00067",
      "start_ms": 98970,
      "end_ms": 100130,
      "text": "家是私人场所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00068",
      "start_ms": 100250,
      "end_ms": 101090,
      "text": "不要提前到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00069",
      "start_ms": 101290,
      "end_ms": 102230,
      "text": "尤其是张总家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00070",
      "start_ms": 102230,
      "end_ms": 102930,
      "text": "孩子还小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00071",
      "start_ms": 103090,
      "end_ms": 104230,
      "text": "正是忙乱的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00072",
      "start_ms": 104390,
      "end_ms": 105730,
      "text": "万一人家突击准备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00073",
      "start_ms": 105790,
      "end_ms": 106550,
      "text": "你提前去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00074",
      "start_ms": 106550,
      "end_ms": 107330,
      "text": "多尴尬呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00075",
      "start_ms": 107330,
      "end_ms": 108470,
      "text": "咱准时到就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00076",
      "start_ms": 108590,
      "end_ms": 108825,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00077",
      "start_ms": 109030,
      "end_ms": 109535,
      "text": "还有啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00078",
      "start_ms": 109740,
      "end_ms": 111520,
      "text": "你赶紧去把你这身西装给换掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00079",
      "start_ms": 111720,
      "end_ms": 113060,
      "text": "人家张总让咱们去他家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00080",
      "start_ms": 113060,
      "end_ms": 114360,
      "text": "那是没把咱们当外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00081",
      "start_ms": 114600,
      "end_ms": 115980,
      "text": "你这穿一身职业装去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00082",
      "start_ms": 116180,
      "end_ms": 117700,
      "text": "这不是跟人家疏远关系吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00083",
      "start_ms": 117740,
      "end_ms": 117980,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00084",
      "start_ms": 118140,
      "end_ms": 122200,
      "text": "我这就去换张总张总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00085",
      "start_ms": 122600,
      "end_ms": 124180,
      "text": "这是思义送给嫂子的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00086",
      "start_ms": 124600,
      "end_ms": 125860,
      "text": "你们俩太客气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00087",
      "start_ms": 126280,
      "end_ms": 126520,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00088",
      "start_ms": 126660,
      "end_ms": 127400,
      "text": "快进快进。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00089",
      "start_ms": 128480,
      "end_ms": 128960,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00090",
      "start_ms": 129260,
      "end_ms": 130880,
      "text": "来了张总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00091",
      "start_ms": 130880,
      "end_ms": 131840,
      "text": "让你们三点来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00092",
      "start_ms": 132080,
      "end_ms": 133400,
      "text": "你们还真三点来啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00093",
      "start_ms": 134440,
      "end_ms": 134680,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00094",
      "start_ms": 134800,
      "end_ms": 135540,
      "text": "这么久了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00095",
      "start_ms": 135560,
      "end_ms": 136860,
      "text": "咋没见嫂子出现呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00096",
      "start_ms": 138240,
      "end_ms": 139260,
      "text": "女主人不出现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00097",
      "start_ms": 139500,
      "end_ms": 140980,
      "text": "大概率就是不欢迎他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00098",
      "start_ms": 141940,
      "end_ms": 142840,
      "text": "你想多了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00099",
      "start_ms": 143620,
      "end_ms": 144400,
      "text": "随风思夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00100",
      "start_ms": 144400,
      "end_ms": 145060,
      "text": "你们来啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00101",
      "start_ms": 145480,
      "end_ms": 145720,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00102",
      "start_ms": 145860,
      "end_ms": 150600,
      "text": "嫂子今天为孩子啊弄得到处都是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00103",
      "start_ms": 151140,
      "end_ms": 152280,
      "text": "还没等收拾完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00104",
      "start_ms": 152580,
      "end_ms": 153420,
      "text": "他就来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00105",
      "start_ms": 154180,
      "end_ms": 156060,
      "text": "也不想想别人方不方便，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00106",
      "start_ms": 156840,
      "end_ms": 159400,
      "text": "真不懂礼数来喝水啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00107",
      "start_ms": 160940,
      "end_ms": 161340,
      "text": "好呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00108",
      "start_ms": 161340,
      "end_ms": 162100,
      "text": "谢谢张总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00109",
      "start_ms": 162260,
      "end_ms": 162480,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00110",
      "start_ms": 162480,
      "end_ms": 163120,
      "text": "谢谢张总。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00111",
      "start_ms": 164260,
      "end_ms": 164500,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00112",
      "start_ms": 165220,
      "end_ms": 166360,
      "text": "就这么决定了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00113",
      "start_ms": 168180,
      "end_ms": 169060,
      "text": "时间不早了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00114",
      "start_ms": 169720,
      "end_ms": 170920,
      "text": "就不在家里做了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00115",
      "start_ms": 171240,
      "end_ms": 172160,
      "text": "咱们出去吃吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00116",
      "start_ms": 173500,
      "end_ms": 173960,
      "text": "好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00117",
      "start_ms": 174540,
      "end_ms": 174780,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00118",
      "start_ms": 174960,
      "end_ms": 175580,
      "text": "正好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00119",
      "start_ms": 175720,
      "end_ms": 176880,
      "text": "我媳妇今晚不在家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00120",
      "start_ms": 176960,
      "end_ms": 177985,
      "text": "都没地儿吃饭了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00121",
      "start_ms": 179760,
      "end_ms": 180340,
      "text": "张总啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00122",
      "start_ms": 180340,
      "end_ms": 181465,
      "text": "我们家还有事儿呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00123",
      "start_ms": 182110,
      "end_ms": 183090,
      "text": "那我们就先走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00124",
      "start_ms": 183290,
      "end_ms": 183605,
      "text": "行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00125",
      "start_ms": 184110,
      "end_ms": 186030,
      "text": "既然有事儿就不留你们了啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00126",
      "start_ms": 186250,
      "end_ms": 186490,
      "text": "哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00127",
      "start_ms": 188100,
      "end_ms": 190040,
      "text": "嗯嗯张总家的茶是真香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00128",
      "start_ms": 190240,
      "end_ms": 191320,
      "text": "刚才聊的太尽兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00129",
      "start_ms": 191320,
      "end_ms": 192125,
      "text": "都忘记尝了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00130",
      "start_ms": 192290,
      "end_ms": 195575,
      "text": "随风你也尝一下好喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00131",
      "start_ms": 196550,
      "end_ms": 197685,
      "text": "那我们就不打扰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00132",
      "start_ms": 197930,
      "end_ms": 199000,
      "text": "张总张总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00133",
      "start_ms": 199040,
      "end_ms": 199620,
      "text": "我们走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00134",
      "start_ms": 199660,
      "end_ms": 200405,
      "text": "下次再见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00135",
      "start_ms": 200850,
      "end_ms": 201550,
      "text": "慢走啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00136",
      "start_ms": 201610,
      "end_ms": 202375,
      "text": "慢走啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00137",
      "start_ms": 204970,
      "end_ms": 206210,
      "text": "咱家哪有什么事儿啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00138",
      "start_ms": 206430,
      "end_ms": 207690,
      "text": "嫂子叫咱出去吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00139",
      "start_ms": 207810,
      "end_ms": 208230,
      "text": "咱不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00140",
      "start_ms": 208230,
      "end_ms": 209195,
      "text": "不是不给面子吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00141",
      "start_ms": 209560,
      "end_ms": 211945,
      "text": "张总夫人看似是在叫你一块儿吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00142",
      "start_ms": 212410,
      "end_ms": 213770,
      "text": "其实是在下逐客令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00143",
      "start_ms": 213910,
      "end_ms": 215405,
      "text": "像是改天一块吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00144",
      "start_ms": 215790,
      "end_ms": 218075,
      "text": "或者是今天不在家吃了出去吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00145",
      "start_ms": 218480,
      "end_ms": 220040,
      "text": "这些都不是真的找你吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00146",
      "start_ms": 220420,
      "end_ms": 221700,
      "text": "而是在下逐客令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00147",
      "start_ms": 221980,
      "end_ms": 222720,
      "text": "那都要走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00148",
      "start_ms": 222720,
      "end_ms": 223925,
      "text": "你怎么还喝起茶来了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00149",
      "start_ms": 224180,
      "end_ms": 225220,
      "text": "喝主人家的茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00150",
      "start_ms": 225460,
      "end_ms": 228465,
      "text": "是对主人家表示尊重啊啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00151",
      "start_ms": 228940,
      "end_ms": 229675,
      "text": "原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00152",
      "start_ms": 229990,
      "end_ms": 230285,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00153",
      "start_ms": 232030,
      "end_ms": 232390,
      "text": "随风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00154",
      "start_ms": 232390,
      "end_ms": 233455,
      "text": "你做事有分寸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00155",
      "start_ms": 234030,
      "end_ms": 236195,
      "text": "公司二把手就需要你这种人才。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00156",
      "start_ms": 236870,
      "end_ms": 238850,
      "text": "这王宇明明业务能力比我强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00157",
      "start_ms": 239170,
      "end_ms": 239810,
      "text": "我怎么还？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00158",
      "start_ms": 240070,
      "end_ms": 241145,
      "text": "能力固然重要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00159",
      "start_ms": 241430,
      "end_ms": 243985,
      "text": "但越是高位的越需要注意人情世故。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00160",
      "start_ms": 244380,
      "end_ms": 245500,
      "text": "王宇连这都不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00161",
      "start_ms": 245640,
      "end_ms": 248035,
      "text": "张总怎么敢放心把副总的位置交给他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00162",
      "start_ms": 248450,
      "end_ms": 249965,
      "text": "就没想到有这么多讲究啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00163",
      "start_ms": 250260,
      "end_ms": 251820,
      "text": "人情世故无小事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00164",
      "start_ms": 252200,
      "end_ms": 253605,
      "text": "细节决定成败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00165",
      "start_ms": 254030,
      "end_ms": 256405,
      "text": "你呀多看看这本闲谈高手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00166",
      "start_ms": 256770,
      "end_ms": 257770,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00167",
      "start_ms": 257910,
      "end_ms": 258590,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00168",
      "start_ms": 258670,
      "end_ms": 259530,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00169",
      "start_ms": 259610,
      "end_ms": 260730,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00170",
      "start_ms": 260910,
      "end_ms": 262145,
      "text": "你就每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00171",
      "start_ms": 262440,
      "end_ms": 263635,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00172",
      "start_ms": 263980,
      "end_ms": 265680,
      "text": "你也会变成一个会说话的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00173",
      "start_ms": 265760,
      "end_ms": 266940,
      "text": "当时听到这句话的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00174",
      "start_ms": 266940,
      "end_ms": 268035,
      "text": "我的眼泪就出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00175",
      "start_ms": 268280,
      "end_ms": 270300,
      "text": "他写的是别人夸你优秀你就回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00176",
      "start_ms": 270520,
      "end_ms": 271480,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00177",
      "start_ms": 271500,
      "end_ms": 272700,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00178",
      "start_ms": 272700,
      "end_ms": 273680,
      "text": "你看很有味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00179",
      "start_ms": 273740,
      "end_ms": 274640,
      "text": "假如不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00180",
      "start_ms": 274660,
      "end_ms": 275300,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00181",
      "start_ms": 275300,
      "end_ms": 276060,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00182",
      "start_ms": 276080,
      "end_ms": 277080,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00183",
      "start_ms": 277200,
      "end_ms": 278335,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00184",
      "start_ms": 278570,
      "end_ms": 279930,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00185",
      "start_ms": 280070,
      "end_ms": 282410,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00186",
      "start_ms": 282610,
      "end_ms": 282850,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00187",
      "start_ms": 282850,
      "end_ms": 283810,
      "text": "这真是太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00188",
      "start_ms": 283810,
      "end_ms": 284650,
      "text": "在这本书里边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00189",
      "start_ms": 284650,
      "end_ms": 285830,
      "text": "有一句话我特别欣赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00190",
      "start_ms": 285910,
      "end_ms": 287570,
      "text": "他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00191",
      "start_ms": 287830,
      "end_ms": 288750,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00192",
      "start_ms": 288790,
      "end_ms": 289770,
      "text": "万物皆有裂痕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00193",
      "start_ms": 289890,
      "end_ms": 291295,
      "text": "那是光照进来的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00194",
      "start_ms": 291580,
      "end_ms": 291780,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00195",
      "start_ms": 291780,
      "end_ms": 292720,
      "text": "这真是太棒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00196",
      "start_ms": 292720,
      "end_ms": 293840,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00197",
      "start_ms": 293860,
      "end_ms": 294280,
      "text": "随便翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00198",
      "start_ms": 294280,
      "end_ms": 294680,
      "text": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00199",
      "start_ms": 294820,
      "end_ms": 295060,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00200",
      "start_ms": 295100,
      "end_ms": 296095,
      "text": "这句话太好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00201",
      "start_ms": 296390,
      "end_ms": 298730,
      "text": "他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00202",
      "start_ms": 298870,
      "end_ms": 300655,
      "text": "你就回比以前好多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00203",
      "start_ms": 300920,
      "end_ms": 302725,
      "text": "现在吃泡面敢放两根肠了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00204",
      "start_ms": 303020,
      "end_ms": 304020,
      "text": "我读到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00205",
      "start_ms": 304020,
      "end_ms": 306200,
      "text": "我觉得这个让我真是一解心开啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00206",
      "start_ms": 306540,
      "end_ms": 308365,
      "text": "这本书就像是个社交宝典，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00207",
      "start_ms": 308760,
      "end_ms": 311805,
      "text": "把各种社交场景都变成了问题加答案的形式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00208",
      "start_ms": 312080,
      "end_ms": 314515,
      "text": "你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00209",
      "start_ms": 314830,
      "end_ms": 317870,
      "text": "就是手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00210",
      "start_ms": 318230,
      "end_ms": 320690,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00211",
      "start_ms": 320690,
      "end_ms": 321870,
      "text": "你就放心拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00212",
      "start_ms": 321930,
      "end_ms": 323290,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00213",
      "start_ms": 323530,
      "end_ms": 326230,
      "text": "这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00214",
      "start_ms": 326350,
      "end_ms": 327890,
      "text": "我觉得这书适合所有人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00215",
      "start_ms": 328030,
      "end_ms": 328550,
      "text": "让你不管，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00216",
      "start_ms": 328550,
      "end_ms": 330705,
      "text": "在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_fd5b9d55019a6363_s00217",
      "start_ms": 331010,
      "end_ms": 331855,
      "text": "所以强烈推荐。"
    }
  ],
